$ and\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂L}{∂{a}_{ij}}={\\sum }_{k=1}^{3}\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{k}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}\n$$\n\nNow, since \n\n$$\n{∇}_{y}L={∇}_{y}({y}^{T}y)=2y,\n$$\n\nwe have that\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{k}}=2{y}_{k}.\n$$\n\nWriting out $y=3Ax-2b$ in component-wise notation as \n\n$$\n{y}_{i}=3{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{a}_{ij}{x}_{j}-2{b}_{i},\n$$\n\nwe have \n\n- $\\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}=3{x}_{j}$ if $i=k$, and\n\n- $\\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}=0$ if $i\\ne k.$\n\nThis means that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂L}{∂{a}_{ij}} & ={\\sum }_{k=1}^{3}\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{k}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{i}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{i}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =2{y}_{i}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{i}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =2{y}_{i}\\cdot 3{x}_{j} \\\\  & =6{y}_{i}{x}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $(i,j)$th entry of ${∇}_{A}L$ is $6$ times the $i$th entry of $y$ multiplied by the $j$th entry of $x$, so\n\n$$\n{∇}_{A}L=6y\\cdot {x}^{T}.\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating ${∇}_{A}L$ at $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{A}L & =6y\\cdot {x}^{T} \\\\  & =6(3Ax-2b)\\cdot {x}^{T} \\\\  & =6(3[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-2[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}])\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =6(3[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}])\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-24 \\\\ 132 \\\\ 216\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -96 \\\\ 0 & 528 \\\\ 0 & 864\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534022 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7206ccb2-06f9-5d76-963e-53f626cd93e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-70" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533409}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer