∂{y}_{k}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}\n$$\n\nNow, since \n\n$$\n{∇}_{y}L={∇}_{y}({y}^{T}y)=2y,\n$$\n\nwe have that\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{k}}=2{y}_{k}.\n$$\n\nWriting out $y=2Ax-b$ in component-wise notation as \n\n$$\n{y}_{i}=2{\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}{a}_{ij}{x}_{j}-{b}_{i},\n$$\n\nwe have \n\n- $\\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}=2{x}_{j}$ if $i=k$, and\n\n- $\\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}}=0$ if $i\\ne k.$\n\nThis means that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂L}{∂{a}_{ij}} & ={\\sum }_{k=1}^{2}\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{k}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{k}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂L}{∂{y}_{i}}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{i}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =2{y}_{i}\\cdot \\frac{∂{y}_{i}}{∂{a}_{ij}} \\\\  & =2{y}_{i}\\cdot 2{x}_{j} \\\\  & =4{y}_{i}{x}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n The $(i,j)$th entry of ${∇}_{A}L$ is $4$ times the $i$th entry of $y$ multiplied by the $j$th entry of $x$, so\n\n$$\n{∇}_{A}L=4y\\cdot {x}^{T}.\n$$\n\n Finally, evaluating ${∇}_{A}L$ at $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{A}L & =4y\\cdot {x}^{T} \\\\  & =4(2Ax-b)\\cdot {x}^{T} \\\\  & =4(2[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}])\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}10 & 10 & -5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =4([\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 110\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}])\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}10 & 10 & -5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}48 \\\\ 428\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}10 & 10 & -5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}480 & 480 & -240 \\\\ 4280 & 4280 & -2140\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186542139 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed298814-70d0-5656-b6e2-258ce3641ddb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-992" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541924}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-992" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218654